*> PLB-Q011 cursor-opened-in-loop: EXEC SQL OPEN on every pass of a loop
*> that never closes the cursor.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CURLOOP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-PASS             PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01  WS-ID               PIC X(8).
    EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE ACCT-CUR CURSOR FOR
        SELECT ACCT_ID FROM ACCOUNTS
    END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE CARD-CUR CURSOR FOR
        SELECT CARD_ID FROM CARDS
    END-EXEC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    *> Reported: opened on every pass, closed after the loop.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-PASS > 3
        EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
        EXEC SQL FETCH ACCT-CUR INTO :WS-ID END-EXEC
        ADD 1 TO WS-PASS
    END-PERFORM
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    *> Not reported: closed in a paragraph the loop performs.
    PERFORM READ-CARD 3 TIMES
    STOP RUN.
READ-CARD.
    EXEC SQL OPEN CARD-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL FETCH CARD-CUR INTO :WS-ID END-EXEC
    PERFORM CLOSE-CARD.
CLOSE-CARD.
    EXEC SQL CLOSE CARD-CUR END-EXEC.
